{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224170","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1622417001:1":{"text":"啾啾！还等什么，<style=\"highlight\">瑟卡</style>？大家已经饿得不行了！那个<style=\"highlight\">人类女孩</style>又送鱼来了！新鲜的猫鱼，肥美多汁！","source_cn":"啾啾！还等什么，<style=highlight>瑟卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82D4F7461F6E0554","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1622417002:1":{"text":"要我说，有吃的就赶紧吃！这么好的机会，不吃白不吃！","source_cn":"要我说，有吃的就赶紧吃！这么好的机会，不吃白不吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6121456FEDCF5432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1622417003:1":{"text":"多数候鸟虚弱地簇拥在这只候鸟身后，目光望向小鱼，鸟喙微动，显然认同它的想法。","source_cn":"多数候鸟虚弱地簇拥在这只候鸟身后，目光望向小鱼，鸟喙微...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93DF12230B4BB66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1622417004:1":{"text":"叽——<style=\"highlight\">布尔</style>！<style=\"highlight\">头鸟</style>还没开口，我们怎么能擅自取食？","source_cn":"叽——<style=highlight>布尔</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EACBD5FF91A4A4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622417005:1":{"text":"根据先祖的规矩，我们应该自己去觅食。接受人类的施舍，这不符合候鸟的尊严！","source_cn":"根据先祖的规矩，我们应该自己去觅食。接受人类的施舍，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C60DD10D87C277E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1622417006:1":{"text":"少数几只眼神锐利的候鸟站在瑟卡身旁，但它们的羽毛凌乱稀疏，身型孱弱，状态十分糟糕。","source_cn":"少数几只眼神锐利的候鸟站在瑟卡身旁，但它们的羽毛凌乱稀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x275F079F89F93542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622417007:1":{"text":"说得轻巧，这几天咱们在这片森林里找到过什么像样的食物？","source_cn":"说得轻巧，这几天咱们在这片森林里找到过什么像样的食物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDD5FEFE742563AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622417008:1":{"text":"不吃？不吃就得饿死！你看看大伙儿！","source_cn":"不吃？不吃就得饿死！你看看大伙儿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD05896F50B958E7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622417009:1":{"text":"可……这会让我们失去候鸟的尊严。","source_cn":"可……这会让我们失去候鸟的尊严。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FAB5E24F9B78819","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1622417010:1":{"text":"你的翅膀伤得最重！然后你还要我们陪你一起饿死？凭什么！","source_cn":"你的翅膀伤得最重！然后你还要我们陪你一起饿死？凭什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A62C3838079F649","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":